/** @page maestro_pro_features Maestro Pro Features
 *  @brief Consolidated page for Pro-only workflows and advanced extensions.
 *
 *  @details
 *  Maestro Pro extends the standard playback workflows with additional runtime control,
 *  advanced loading options, harmonic tools, and script-based MIDI authoring.
 *
 *  This page centralizes all Pro feature families, including MidiSynth-specific
 *  extensions, so Pro capabilities are discoverable from a single chapter.
 *
 *  @section pro_workflows Pro Workflow Pages
 *
 *  - @subpage midifileplayer_pro
 *  - @subpage midistreamplayer_pro
 *  - @subpage mptkinnerloop_concept
 *  - @subpage mptk_spatial_audio_workflow
 *  - @subpage mptkwriter_concept
 *
 *  @section pro_midisynth MidiSynth Pro Extensions
 *
 *  @subsection pro_callbacks Real-Time Callbacks
 *  - @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.OnAudioFrameStart : audio-thread callback per frame (avoid Unity API).
 *  - @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.OnMidiEvent : preprocess/transform MIDI events before playback.
 *  - @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.OnBeatEvent : beat-level timing hook (time, tick, measure, beat).
 *
 *  @subsection pro_voice Voice Control Utilities
 *  - @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_PauseVoices and @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_ResumeVoices for smooth global fade-out/fade-in.
 *  - Direct event APIs: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_PlayDirectEvent , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_StopDirectEvent .
 *
 *  @subsection pro_spatial MIDI Spatial Mapper
 *  - Routing modes: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.ModeSpatializer.Channel , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.ModeSpatializer.Track .
 *  - Master/Slave coordination: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_IsSpatialSynthMaster , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_SpatialSynthEnabled .
 *  - Track metadata helpers: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_InstrumentPlayed , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_InstrumentNum , @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_TrackName .
 *
 *  @subsection pro_effects Unity Effect Integration
 *  - Global Unity effects via @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_EffectUnity (Reverb, Chorus).
 *  - Configure in inspector (Synth Parameters / Unity Effect) or by script.
 *
 *  @subsection pro_when When to Use MidiSynth Pro Extensions
 *  - Tight timing/generative music: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.OnAudioFrameStart .
 *  - Live filtering/transposition: @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.OnMidiEvent .
 *  - Immersive 3D audio: enable MidiSpatializer routing with @ref MidiPlayerTK.MidiSynth.MPTK_ModeSpatializer .
 *
 *  @section pro_notes Notes
 *
 *  - MPTKWriter is a <b>Maestro Pro-only</b> workflow dedicated to scripted MIDI authoring.
 *  - Some Pro features extend existing players, while others provide entirely new workflows.
 *
 *  @section pro_related_api Related API Modules
 *  - @ref midifileplayer_pro
 *  - @ref midistreamplayer_pro
 *  - @ref mptkwriter_management
 *  - @ref synth_engine
 */
